  "description": "Na Hui-Ju, a 19-year-old girl that was bullied at school was reborn as 'Aileen de Sheia', a dragon. She's happy to feel the strong power that no one has experienced and to feel the love and kindness of the people around me for the first time. \n\nAs some make their every effort to get ahold of her, some also make their every effort to get rid of her. \n\n(Source: Kakao, translated)",
